  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Banana Production and Capacity Bulding Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The implementation of GIE DOOKUWO project will directly impact, in addition to the 98 producers, indirectly 175 producers and 1500 farmers. It will also impact the 7 polarized villages of the Tmento zone, Hamdallaye, Diattacounda, Djibanar, Djimoucounda, Limana and Thiar..The banana market is very flourishing and affects several segments of Senegalese society.</narrative>
  </description>
